# Type constructor application: Dict/Record type assertion and Map[K V]
# [@[a: Int] ...] performs a structural record type check at compile time.
# [@[Map K V] ...] uses the Map type constructor registered in tycon_env (T-1018).
[
  r1: [@[a: Int] [a: 1]]
  r2: [@[Map String Int] [a: 1  b: 2]]
]
=== out
["r1": Dict({"a": Int(1)})  "r2": ["a": 1  "b": 2]]
